  "lazy_chunk": {
    "root_cause": "A cold Technical navigation produced 'TypeError: Failed to fetch dynamically imported module: .../TechnicalPage-CfX_WJzv.js' even though the packaged server returned 200 for that asset. The route is a Vite lazy chunk; Lazy.tsx had no error/retry path, so the route stayed on its skeleton and the probe timed out.",
    "prior_evidence": "artifacts/desktop-migration/m2/installed-cold/summary-full.json (run 1 error, 2026-10-25)",
    "fix": "Lazy.tsx retries the same dynamic import with 300/1200/3000 ms backoff; if the route still fails, it reloads once per route per 60 s (Chromium caches failed module fetches) and shows a Persian error with a manual retry instead of looping. Lazy loading and route code-splitting remain enabled.",
